    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1474">

                <pb facs="1169" n="1159" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg1159"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.8571/5–3049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-05-30T11:00:00+08:00">May 30, 1949—11 a.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received May 30—5:11 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1887. Deptel 1081, May 28. Department will appreciate that I did not expect
                    publicity regarding my 1840, May 26, but did hope forwarding it, particularly in
                    plain language, might prove useful as it seems to have. Could not explain at
                    time in classified message due to overloaded facilities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cabot</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
